#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0xfb0 (id 0xc4, record 186), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0xfb0/1
msgid "\"Attack,\" \"Control,\" \"Mobility,\" and \"Sense.\""
